le UNC5221 BRICKSTORM SPAWNCHIMERA April 2024", "url": "https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/ivanti-post-exploitation-lateral-movement"}, {"description": "NVISO Incident Response. (2025, April 1). BRICKSTORM Backdoor Analysis: A Persistent Espionage Threat to European Industries. Retrieved April 16, 2026.", "source_name": "NVISO BRICKSTORM April 2025", "url": "https://blog.nviso.eu/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/NVISO-BRICKSTORM-Report.pdf"}, {"description": "Sarah Yoder, John Wolfram, Ashley Pearson, Doug Bienstock, Josh Madeley, Josh Murchie, Brad Slaybaugh, Matt Lin, Geoff Carstairs, Austin Larsen. (2025, September 24). Another BRICKSTORM: Stealthy Backdoor Enabling Espionage into Tech and Legal Sectors. Retrieved April 16, 2026.", "source_name": "Google BRICKSTORM September 2025", "url": "https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/brickstorm-espionage-campaign"}], "id": "relationship--da68918d-d389-4e05-a5fa-980888e57157", "modified": "2026-04-29T14:23:06.223Z", "object_marking_refs": ["marking-definition--fa42a846-8d90-4e51-bc29-71d5b4802168"], "relationship_type": "uses", "revoked": false, "source_ref": "malware--0450ed20-e9a7-4799-b601-2f2710300796", "spec_version": "2.1", "target_ref": "attack-pattern--7bc57495-ea59-4380-be31-a64af124ef18", "type": "relationship", "x_mitre_attack_spec_version": "3.3.0", "x_mitre_deprecated": false, "x_mitre_modified_by_ref": "identity--c78cb6e5-0c4b-4611-8297-d1b8b55e40b5"}', 'kb-doc-09-mitre-attack-p0-13520', 0, 289, '09-mitre-attack', 'retrieved', '5D645A3370B1AE13DE03A47DD1F5DF155F08A65F9DD972FE309D713D60C91DFC', 'v1', '{"source_id": "09-mitre-attack", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "STRUCTURED_DATA"}')
